e limit, called awardee A here, has 3. Contract [1], for 39,900 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts near the legal limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market pricing, budget constraints, or multiple separate needs. Statistical patterns alone do not indicate wrongdoing without further investigation.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the December contracts to see if they align with other contracts. Review awardee A’s contracts to determine if they represent a pattern or separate projects. Contract [1] shows a near-limit award in December; compare it with others to assess consistency.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["URo3SO8TD8d6nTs9LZ9RhQ%3D%3D","7smulBOKUWc%2FbjW6njtWLw%3D%3D","l6iQfV1Pp5J9PLkba5eRog%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}